cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the code in this repository, please cite the article listed under
  preferred-citation.
type: software
title: >-
  ARPIA: A multi-scale heterogeneous graph neural network for mobile device
  geolocation with explicit non-connection modeling (code)
abstract: >-
  Code of the article "ARPIA: A multi-scale heterogeneous graph neural network
  for mobile device geolocation with explicit non-connection modeling"
  (Ad Hoc Networks, 2026). It holds the data preparation (target enrichment,
  triangulation and edge generation), the normalization, the construction of
  the heterogeneous graph, the training code of ARPIA and of the GATv2, HAN and
  RGCN variants, the ablation and sensitivity scripts, the classical
  localization baselines and the computational cost measurement.
